# neo-tree personal hides — primeslice/backend
# Nothing is active. Uncomment lines to hide, or add your own.
#
# NAMES — exact match against a directory or file name anywhere in the tree:
# (these go into neo-tree's hide_by_name)
#
# node_modules
# vendor
# .terraform
#
# PATTERNS — glob-style, matched against the full absolute path:
# Prefix with * so the pattern matches as a path suffix, not an exact path.
# (these go into neo-tree's hide_by_pattern)
#
# */migrations
# */generated
# */fixtures
#
# Toggle everything off temporarily with Shift+H in the sidebar.
*/backend/services/accounting
